    "updated_at": "2017-11-27T19:20:57Z",
    "body": "The \"official\" Greasemonkey 4 polyfill API script, implements GM.registerMenuCommand using HTML5 context menus: https://github.com/greasemonkey/gm4-polyfill\r\nI have also started using html5 context menus via my own userscript library. Maybe more people will discover it and use it with the launch of GM4? I wasn't aware of its existence until Greasemonkey started promoting its use, and I'm sure its existence is a surprise for a lot of other people than me...",
